    art: 
    arrival: 'Rattles[happy]: RATTLES IS HERE! Attic room, obviously. Nobody else
      gets the good rafters.

      Mirrors give me the creeps. And it''s quiet up
      there. Too quiet. Someone come visit?'
    story:
    - 'Rattles: Nobody ever wants to be my neighbour. It''s the chains. People hate
      the chains.'
    - 'Rattles[happy]: Turns out the chains were from a swing set! I was just...
      swinging. For forty years.'
    checkout: 'Rattles[happy]: Keep the chain! Swing responsibly!'
